@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 17
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 17
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam ArrowColor #31546F
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A91A5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2F75B5
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam ActorBorderColor #2F75B5
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

actor 用户 as User
boundary "检索界面" as UI
control "检索控制器" as Search
control "权限校验" as Gate
control "检索服务" as Retrieval
database "版本索引" as Index

User -> UI : 显式选择文档集并输入查询
UI -> Search : 提交Query与DocumentSet
Search -> Gate : 校验每个文档版本的访问权限
Gate --> Search : 返回允许版本与拒绝原因

alt 没有可检索文档
  Search --> UI : 返回空范围，不调用索引
else 存在授权版本
  Search -> Retrieval : 传入授权版本、查询和过滤条件
  Retrieval -> Index : 仅检索允许版本
  Index --> Retrieval : 返回命中、来源版本与相关度
  Retrieval --> Search : 排序并标记冲突或陈旧结果
  Search --> UI : 展示结果与来源，不扩大查询范围
end
UI --> User : 可按来源文档继续核验
@enduml
